// Storage, built rather than bought.
//
// A cell bank used to cost 8 poles, which made "I keep browning out at
// night" a problem you spent your way out of. Costing cells instead
// means the answer is to run the forge — which costs charge — so it is
// the first place in the game where fixing a problem costs the resource
// the problem is about (`SYSTEMS.md` §5.3).
#![enable(implicit_some)]
ItemDef(
    id: "item.charge_cells",
    name: "Charge cells",
    glyph: "🔋",
    order: 44,
)
